 "is_free": false,
 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/783412420f34b84dec289f3403978d19.poster.avif?t=1788471897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/783412420f34b84dec289f3403978d19.webm?t=1788471897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/783412420f34b84dec289f3403978d19.mp4?t=1788471897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >本作不是传统的自走棋：没有羁绊连锁，没有利息与连败经济，也没有局外数值成长。每一局的强度，完全来自你在局内发现的英雄养成、装备与遗物组合。如果你喜欢《杀戮尖塔》式的“每局从零构筑”，这款游戏正是为你准备的。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/53d1a8cefa51c40b4a2aefc8a720ebbd.avif?t=1788471897\" width=1551 height=151 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每一局都是全新的挑战。每一次旅程，你都会获得不同的英雄、装备、遗物与强化选择。没有 PvP Meta 的束缚，也没有固定答案，每一局游戏都是一道全新的策略谜题。随着你不断深入游戏，你将逐渐掌握各种组合之间的奥秘，学会根据局势灵活调整阵容，把一支临时拼凑的小队，打造成为所向披靡的传奇公会。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/871eb08d861b5fc7a292bd8e63cbe8a2.poster.avif?t=1788471897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/871eb08d861b5fc7a292bd8e63cbe8a2.webm?t=1788471897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/871eb08d861b5fc7a292bd8e63cbe8a2.mp4?t=1788471897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/7d91e4f55a1c304c2fd2d9eac07ffdcd.avif?t=1788471897\" width=1551 height=151 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每位英雄都有自己的初始职业与技能，但他们的成长方向完全由你决定。500 多种成长方式，让每位英雄都拥有无限可能。你可以让后排治疗师化身冲锋陷阵的前排坦克；也可以把远程输出培养成近战狂战士。甚至还能让一对恋人并肩作战，在战场上获得高速成长加成，创造更多意想不到的组合。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/99c9771514fe86f3f1d700a7c500fd82.poster.avif?t=1788471897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/99c9771514fe86f3f1d700a7c500fd82.webm?t=1788471897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/99c9771514fe86f3f1d700a7c500fd82.mp4?t=1788471897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/34cb21531f07d97224a0f217eef7e4a2.avif?t=1788471897\" width=1551 height=151 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>解锁海量英雄、装备与遗物。每一次冒险都将不断解锁全新内容。</strong>仅 Demo 版本便包含：25 位英雄；180 种专精路线；300+ 件遗物和100+ 件装备，等待你的不断探索与搭配。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>畅所欲玩。没有倒计时。没有排队等待。</strong>没有 PvP 压力。你可以尽情思考每一步策略，在任何时候保存进度，等有时间时再继续挑战。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>打破职业限制，创造属于你的流派。</strong>25 位英雄，75 条成长路线。跨职业叠加的强化效果，让任何英雄都能突破原本定位。招募、升级、重塑专精，打造各种“不讲道理”的超强阵容，让每一局游戏都充满无限可能。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>挑战八大难度。</strong>每完成一次挑战，都将解锁更高一级难度。随着新的词缀不断加入，每一轮挑战都会变得更加复杂，也更具策略深度。当你成功征服所有难度后，还可以进入无尽模式，冲击全球排行榜，挑战真正的极限。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>每周持续更新，与社区共同塑造游戏。自今年 1 月 Alpha 测试开启以来，《裂隙远征》始终保持每周更新。</strong>我们持续根据玩家反馈优化游戏内容、平衡玩法，并不断加入全新机制。欢迎加入社区，与我们一起见证《裂隙远征》的成长，并共同塑造它的未来。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/707cd7931d74e266b01bfac778c377ef.avif?t=1788471897\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras_big/707cd7931d74e266b01bfac778c377ef.webp?t=1788471897 width=1560 height=486 /></span></p>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/783412420f34b84dec289f3403978d19.poster.avif?t=1788471897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/783412420f34b84dec289f3403978d19.webm?t=1788471897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/783412420f34b84dec289f3403978d19.mp4?t=1788471897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >本作不是传统的自走棋：没有羁绊连锁，没有利息与连败经济，也没有局外数值成长。每一局的强度，完全来自你在局内发现的英雄养成、装备与遗物组合。如果你喜欢《杀戮尖塔》式的“每局从零构筑”，这款游戏正是为你准备的。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/53d1a8cefa51c40b4a2aefc8a720ebbd.avif?t=1788471897\" width=1551 height=151 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每一局都是全新的挑战。每一次旅程，你都会获得不同的英雄、装备、遗物与强化选择。没有 PvP Meta 的束缚，也没有固定答案，每一局游戏都是一道全新的策略谜题。随着你不断深入游戏，你将逐渐掌握各种组合之间的奥秘，学会根据局势灵活调整阵容，把一支临时拼凑的小队，打造成为所向披靡的传奇公会。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/871eb08d861b5fc7a292bd8e63cbe8a2.poster.avif?t=1788471897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/871eb08d861b5fc7a292bd8e63cbe8a2.webm?t=1788471897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/871eb08d861b5fc7a292bd8e63cbe8a2.mp4?t=1788471897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/7d91e4f55a1c304c2fd2d9eac07ffdcd.avif?t=1788471897\" width=1551 height=151 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每位英雄都有自己的初始职业与技能，但他们的成长方向完全由你决定。500 多种成长方式，让每位英雄都拥有无限可能。你可以让后排治疗师化身冲锋陷阵的前排坦克；也可以把远程输出培养成近战狂战士。甚至还能让一对恋人并肩作战，在战场上获得高速成长加成，创造更多意想不到的组合。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/99c9771514fe86f3f1d700a7c500fd82.poster.avif?t=1788471897\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/99c9771514fe86f3f1d700a7c500fd82.webm?t=1788471897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/99c9771514fe86f3f1d700a7c500fd82.mp4?t=1788471897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/34cb21531f07d97224a0f217eef7e4a2.avif?t=1788471897\" width=1551 height=151 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>解锁海量英雄、装备与遗物。每一次冒险都将不断解锁全新内容。</strong>仅 Demo 版本便包含：25 位英雄；180 种专精路线；300+ 件遗物和100+ 件装备，等待你的不断探索与搭配。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>畅所欲玩。没有倒计时。没有排队等待。</strong>没有 PvP 压力。你可以尽情思考每一步策略，在任何时候保存进度，等有时间时再继续挑战。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>打破职业限制，创造属于你的流派。</strong>25 位英雄，75 条成长路线。跨职业叠加的强化效果，让任何英雄都能突破原本定位。招募、升级、重塑专精，打造各种“不讲道理”的超强阵容，让每一局游戏都充满无限可能。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>挑战八大难度。</strong>每完成一次挑战，都将解锁更高一级难度。随着新的词缀不断加入，每一轮挑战都会变得更加复杂，也更具策略深度。当你成功征服所有难度后，还可以进入无尽模式，冲击全球排行榜，挑战真正的极限。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>每周持续更新，与社区共同塑造游戏。自今年 1 月 Alpha 测试开启以来，《裂隙远征》始终保持每周更新。</strong>我们持续根据玩家反馈优化游戏内容、平衡玩法，并不断加入全新机制。欢迎加入社区，与我们一起见证《裂隙远征》的成长，并共同塑造它的未来。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras/707cd7931d74e266b01bfac778c377ef.avif?t=1788471897\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669200/extras_big/707cd7931d74e266b01bfac778c377ef.webp?t=1788471897 width=1560 height=486 /></span></p>",
 "short_description": "在这款 PvE 肉鸽自动战斗游戏中，玩家需要将一支普通小队培养成势不可挡的战斗机器，击溃一波又一波怪物。打破职业限制，在每一局中现场发掘英雄、装备与遗物的全新搭配，打造属于你自己的流派。按自己的节奏封印裂隙，并揭开撕裂世界的幕后真相。",
 "supported_languages": "英语<strong>*</strong>, 德语, 葡萄牙语 - 巴西, 俄语, 简体中文, 繁体中文, 西班牙语 - 西班牙<br><strong>*</strong>具有完全音频支持的语言",
 "reviews": "“This may be my favorite Auto-battler Roguelike”<br>Retromation <br><br>“One of the best autobattlers I've played in ages!”<br>Wanderbots <br><br>“One of the biggest Roguelikes this year, and it came out of nowhere!”<br>Gohjoe<br>",
